# Local secrets and credentials
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
class-ai-*-firebase-adminsdk-*.json
*service-account*.json
*.jks

# The root client config is a duplicate; keep the Android config required by Gradle.
google-services.json
!classai/app/google-services.json

# Dependencies, caches, generated files, and local runtime data
**/node_modules/
**/.venv/
**/__pycache__/
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.mypy_cache/
**/.gradle/
**/.kotlin/
**/build/
**/dist/
**/.vite/
**/.vite-temp/
*.py[cod]
*.log
*.tmp
*.db
*.sqlite*
.teacher-build-check/

# Nonessential local metadata and generated reports
classai/metadata.json
teacher-web/tsconfig.tsbuildinfo

# Keep the root README requested for the initial commit; ignore other Markdown docs.
*.md
!README.md
